{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>קנה.</b> It is קנה [cane] of spice." "<b>וחלב.</b> [As for] the sin-offerings, you did not satisfy Me with them. And behold, it is deficient [of] bet, like ששת ימים (Exodus 20:11)." "<b>אך העבדתני.</b> The Torah speaks in the language of human beings. And the meaning is: because of your sins I became in the eyes of the nations like a servant who has no power. And likewise the meaning of הוגעתני."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:50.474029283Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}